# Article PDFs and publisher supplementary files are NEVER published here.
#
# Every folder in data_external/ has a README_provenance.md recording the licence of
# its source. Most are not openly licensed (publisher "all rights reserved", or a
# licence that could not be confirmed), and the two that are CC BY are kept out for
# consistency rather than tracked selectively. What IS published is the extracted
# numeric data (facts, not copyrightable) and the provenance documentation.
#
# The article PDFs are held in the author's local working copy only. Anyone
# reproducing this work should obtain them from the DOIs cited in each
# README_provenance.md, through their own institutional access.

*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
